OL,3,GNEWSABird flu case confirmed as 'all
OL,4,Apoultry on site' to be culled
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 24,000 birds will be culled after
OL,7,Fa case of bird flu at a commercial
OL,8,Fpoultry farm has been confirmed.
OL,10,FMandatory disease control measures,
OL,11,F"including the humane culling of all
OL,12,Fpoultry on the site" and the
OL,13,Fintroduction of a 3km protection zone
OL,14,Fand 10km surveillance zone around the
OL,15,Finfected premises in Coagh, County
OL,16,FTyrone, was initiated from 17:00 GMT on
OL,17,FMonday.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
