OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABird flu case confirmed as 'all
OL,4,Apoultry on site' to be culled
OL,5,
OL,6,FMandatory housing measures for all kept
OL,7,Fbirds and poultry are to come into
OL,8,Fforce across Northern Ireland from
OL,9,F00:01 GMT on Thursday. A ban on poultry
OL,10,Fgatherings will also come into force.
OL,12,FAgriculture minister Andrew Muir said
OL,13,Fit is imperative all bird owners adhere
OL,14,Fto "all biosecurity measures to protect
OL,15,Ftheir flocks".
